abstract: >-
  Data and code for a forensic measurement of how far the upstream provenance
  before a cryptocurrency mixer deposit reaches across distinct laundering
  actors. Includes an evidence-gated dataset of 169 Tornado Cash entrance
  deposits, the reference feature-extraction code, the cross-actor evaluation,
  the temporally balanced background control, and the figure scripts that
  regenerate Figures 3-7 and C1 from the archived data.
keywords:
  - cryptocurrency mixer
  - anti-money-laundering forensics
  - upstream provenance
  - cross-actor generalization
  - missingness audit
